    51	Quizzes are graded locally by `src/lib/quiz-grading.ts` — exactly for multiple choice, true/false, and multi-blank fill-ins, and by a partial-credit heuristic for written answers, which the teacher then judges properly when the results are reported back as a learner turn. Submitting a card sends that report as a normal message, so the whole exchange stays in the transcript. Answers are also held in memory by `src/state/card-state.ts` so a completed card scrolled off screen comes back completed.
